{
  "sequence_id": "seq_f7f9d9dbf5b05cb5",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Mornin'..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "So, which one are you now?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Aren't you...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "During"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Satoru gojo."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I teach first- years at Jujutsu high."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "JUJUTSU..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Where are my friends ?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "KREAK"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Where's fushi- Guro?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "What's up with this?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "KREAK"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Kneak"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'm not sure if you should be worried about other people right now..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "YUJ ITADORI."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Your secret execution ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...has been set!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You're cursed, so I will exercise you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "hold up, it's not a problem."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "More importantly, you and I are pretty beat up."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Fsh"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "We need to get to a hospital."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Is it the cursed object or itadori talking right now?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I CAN'T TELL!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "CRAP!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What should I do?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "What's the situation?"
    }
  ],
